{"term": {"label": "仁", "occurrences": 18, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "莫", "id": "莫"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8309801823813363, "source": "里", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.3609765531356006, "source": "里", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0245043165143877, "source": "端", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0245043165143877, "source": "端", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.717651497074333, "source": "端", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.1231166051824975, "source": "端", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.6678293725756554, "source": "今", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.8909729238898652, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8909729238898652, "source": "今", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.5841201044498106, "source": "今", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6711314814394402, "source": "智", "target": "夫子"}, {"weight": 2.4595888418037104, "source": "智", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.159484249353372, "source": "政", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.159484249353372, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.550046336919272, "source": "政", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.1786549963416462, "source": "義", "target":